      583.96,
      550.73,
      640.27
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts. Fairly heavy falls about 75 mm are likely at some places in Western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Galle and Matara districts.",
